# === PostgreSQL (Docker Compose) ===
POSTGRES_USER=your_db_user_here
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_db_password_here
POSTGRES_DB=your_db_name_here

# === Cloudflare Tunnel (production only) ===
# Tunnel is managed externally (cloudflared installed on host or as a separate service).
# Configure via: Cloudflare Zero Trust > Networks > Tunnels > your tunnel
# Public Hostname should point to: http://api:8000 (or http://localhost:8000 if not in Docker)
# No token needed here — cloudflared reads its config directly from the Cloudflare dashboard.
